```javascript
import { tracked } from '@ember/object';

export default Model.extend({
  tracked: true,
  serialNumber: tracked('serialNumber'),
  serialNumberChanged: (previousValue, newValue) => {
    this.tracking.trackSerialNumberUpdated(this); // The service function
  }
});
```

The `tracked` option enables tracking of properties.  The `serialNumber` property is now tracked. The `serialNumberChanged` function is replaced with a callback function that receives the `previousValue` and `newValue` of the `serialNumber` property.  This callback is executed whenever `serialNumber` changes, effectively replacing the observer.  The `tracked` option must be set to `true` on the model to enable tracking.

