* **Rendering the Teams**:  The `{{#each this.teams.entries as [teamId, teamData]}}` loop iterates through the filtered teams and displays them.  The `{{#if @selected (eq teamId @selected)}} selected{{/if}}` part adds a `selected` class to the currently selected team item, which you can use for styling.
